<title>PORTUGAL: EDP privatisation price 2,250 esc/shr.</title>
<headline>EDP privatisation price 2,250 esc/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese government fixed a price of 2,250 escudos per share in the privatisation of 30 percent of the capital of state utility EDP-Electricidade de Portugal, bourse officials said.</p>
<p>The price was the upper limit of a range between 1,750 and 2,250 escudos per share previously set by the cabinet.</p>
</text>
